<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:draw="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:drawing:1.0" xmlns:svg="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:svg-compatible:1.0" xmlns:presentation="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:presentation:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.presentation">
<office:body><office:presentation><draw:page draw:name="p1"><draw:frame svg:x="1cm" svg:y="1cm" svg:width="24cm" svg:height="3cm" presentation:class="outline"><draw:text-box><text:p>HengDesk Knowledge Base Quarterly Report</text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame><draw:frame svg:x="1cm" svg:y="5cm" svg:width="24cm" svg:height="3cm" presentation:class="outline"><draw:text-box><text:p>This report summarizes knowledge base usage in the third quarter, including ingested documents, retrieval hit rate and user satisfaction.</text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame></draw:page><draw:page draw:name="p2"><draw:frame svg:x="1cm" svg:y="1cm" svg:width="24cm" svg:height="3cm" presentation:class="outline"><draw:text-box><text:p>For access control the system applies a pre-filter so that users can only retrieve chunks from documents they are allowed to read.</text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame><draw:frame svg:x="1cm" svg:y="5cm" svg:width="24cm" svg:height="3cm" presentation:class="outline"><draw:text-box><text:p>Next quarter we plan to add incremental indexing and automatic expiry to reduce the cost of rebuilding indexes.</text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame></draw:page></office:presentation></office:body></office:document>